(7540502, 1206821, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>A great image that contributes to the challenge well<br/> <br/>A most appropriate choice for the challenge Susan. I like your mono presentation, the composition is perfect but what completes it is the concentrated but featureless expression of the driver, it works well. Your timing is good too, capturing the destruction as the bucket ''bites'' into the debris. Congratulations on your placing and score, well done</td>', 'Hello from the critique club A great image that contributes to the challenge well A most appropriate choice for the challenge Susan. I like your mono presentation, the composition is perfect but what completes it is the concentrated but featureless expression of the driver, it works well. Your timing is good too, capturing the destruction as the bucket ''bites'' into the debris. Congratulations on your placing and score, well done', '2017-10-23 05:59:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7540503, 1206674, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>A great image that contributes to the challenge well<br/> <br/>Ah the green heron again! I agree with you about the spiders focus but its still a great image Ronnie and the spider is detailed enough to be an integral part of the image so it adds impact it doesnt detract which is the all important consideration. Its a very appropriate contribution to the challenge, well done again Ronnie</td>', 'Hello from the critique club A great image that contributes to the challenge well Ah the green heron again! I agree with you about the spiders focus but its still a great image Ronnie and the spider is detailed enough to be an integral part of the image so it adds impact it doesnt detract which is the all important consideration. Its a very appropriate contribution to the challenge, well done again Ronnie', '2017-10-23 06:03:51.000000', NULL, 0),
